  "prefLabel": "Pda 707.06 Written Notification and Return of Permit Required in Certain Circumstances",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 707.06 Written Notification and Return of Permit Required in Certain Circumstances.\n\n(a) A permit holder shall provide written notification to the division within 15 days of the sale or other disposition of the vessel for which a state-owned restricted pier slip permit has been issued.\n\n(b) A person required under (a) above to provide written notification to the division shall return the permit to the division within 15 days of the event requiring notification under (a) above.\n\nSource. #8845, eff 3-21-07; ss by #10949, eff 10-20-15; ss by #14376, eff 9-20-25, EXPIRES: 9-20-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pda100-700.html"
